OL,3,ACrew unaware of risks before Bayesian
OL,4,Ayacht accident, say investigators
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sinking of the Bayesian unfolded
OL,7,Fwith "extraordinary speed" when a
OL,8,Fviolent downburst of freak
OL,9,Fhurricane-force winds knocked it onto
OL,10,Fits side in less than 15 seconds, the
OL,11,FUK's Marine Accident Investigation
OL,12,FBranch (MAIB) final report said.
OL,14,FSafety information provided to the crew
OL,15,Fdid not identify this type of risk, the
OL,16,FMAIB said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
