OL,3,ACouncil wins legal fight against flags
OL,4,Aon lamp-posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham City Council has won a High
OL,7,FCourt injunction preventing
OL,8,Funauthorised flags being attached to
OL,9,Flamp-posts and other highway
OL,10,Finfrastructure across the city.
OL,12,FThe authority sought the order after
OL,13,Fthousands of St George's flags and
OL,14,Funion jacks were put up by supporters
OL,15,Fof anti-migrant group Raise the Colours
OL,16,Ffrom summer 2025 onwards.
OL,18,FCouncil lawyers argued the displays
OL,19,Fcreated safety risks and fuelled
OL,20,Ftensions, while campaigners said the
OL,21,Fmove would restrict freedom of
OL,22,Fexpression.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
