OL,3,AInside the old gas pipeline where
OL,4,AUkraine is fighting an underground war
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's a new front in the war in
OL,7,FUkraine, and it is underground.
OL,9,FFor the past seven months Ukrainian
OL,10,Fforces have been living and fighting
OL,11,FRussian troops in an old Soviet gas
OL,12,Fpipeline in the north-eastern Kharkiv
OL,13,Fregion.
OL,15,FWith a diameter of just over a metre
OL,16,Fthere is enough room only to crawl. But
OL,17,Fit is relatively safe from the drones
OL,18,Fthat now saturate the skies above the
OL,19,Ffront line ` and make it nigh-on
OL,20,Fimpossible for either side to advance.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
